                    <h1 data-en="Quinceañera DJ & Entertainment Services" data-es="Servicios de DJ y Entretenimiento para Quinceañera">Quinceañera DJ & Entertainment Services</h1>
                    <p class="hero-modern-subtitle" data-en="Professional DJ, Photography & Lighting for Your Quinceañera Celebration" data-es="DJ Profesional, Fotografía e Iluminación para Tu Celebración de Quinceañera">Professional DJ, Photography & Lighting for Your Quinceañera Celebration</p>
                    <div class="hero-modern-cta">
                        <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-primary">📞 Book Your DJ</a>
