                            <div class="hero-stat-label" data-en="Satisfied" data-es="Satisfecho">Satisfied</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Services Section -->
        <section class="services-section" style="padding: 100px 0;">
            <div class="container">
                <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
                    <div style="width: 60px; height: 4px; background: #FF1B6D; margin: 0 auto;"></div>
                </div>
                <h2 data-en="Professional Entertainment for Your Quinceañera" data-es="Entretenimiento Profesional para Tu Quinceañera">Professional Entertainment for Your Quinceañera</h2>
                <p style="padding: 20px 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8;" data-en="Your quinceañera is a once-in-a-lifetime celebration marking your transition into womanhood. Metro Beat Events specializes in creating unforgettable quinceañera experiences with professional DJ services, stunning photography, and dynamic lighting that keeps your guests entertained throughout the night." data-es="Tu quinceañera es una celebración única que marca tu transición a la edad adulta. Metro Beat Events se especializa en crear experiencias inolvidables de quinceañera con servicios profesionales de DJ, fotografía impresionante e iluminación dinámica que mantiene a tus invitados entretenidos toda la noche.">Your quinceañera is a once-in-a-lifetime celebration marking your transition into womanhood. Metro Beat Events specializes in creating unforgettable quinceañera experiences with professional DJ services, stunning photography, and dynamic lighting that keeps your guests entertained throughout the night.</p>
                
                <div class="services-grid">
                    <div class="service-card">
                        <i class="fas fa-headphones"></i>
                        <h3 data-en="DJ + MC Services" data-es="Servicios de DJ + MC">DJ + MC Services</h3>
                        <p data-en="Expert music selection blending traditional and modern hits. Professional MC services to guide your ceremony, dances, and celebrations with energy and style." data-es="Selección experta de música que combina éxitos tradicionales y modernos. Servicios profesionales de MC para guiar tu ceremonia, bailes y celebraciones con energía y estilo.">Expert music selection blending traditional and modern hits. Professional MC services to guide your ceremony, dances, and celebrations with energy and style.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="service-card">
                        <i class="fas fa-camera"></i>
                        <h3 data-en="Event Photography" data-es="Fotografía de Eventos">Event Photography</h3>
                        <p data-en="Capture every precious moment of your special day. Professional photography that preserves memories of your quinceañera celebration forever." data-es="Capture cada momento precioso de tu día especial. Fotografía profesional que preserva los recuerdos de tu celebración de quinceañera para siempre.">Capture every precious moment of your special day. Professional photography that preserves memories of your quinceañera celebration forever.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="service-card">
                        <i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i>
                        <h3 data-en="Uplighting & Ambiance" data-es="Iluminación y Ambiente">Uplighting & Ambiance</h3>
                        <p data-en="Transform your venue with custom uplighting and dynamic lighting effects that create the perfect atmosphere for your celebration." data-es="Transforma tu lugar con iluminación personalizada y efectos de iluminación dinámicos que crean la atmósfera perfecta para tu celebración.">Transform your venue with custom uplighting and dynamic lighting effects that create the perfect atmosphere for your celebration.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Wedding Services Call-Out Section -->
        <section class="weddings" style="padding: 80px 0;">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="weddings-content">
