                        <h2 class="weddings-title" data-en="Also Planning a Wedding?" data-es="¿También Planeas una Boda?">Also Planning a Wedding?</h2>
                        <p class="weddings-description" data-en="We offer the same professional DJ, photography, and lighting services for your wedding day. Our dedicated team works closely with you to create a personalized experience that reflects your unique love story." data-es="Ofrecemos los mismos servicios profesionales de DJ, fotografía e iluminación para el día de tu boda. Nuestro equipo dedicado trabaja estrechamente contigo para crear una experiencia personalizada que refleje tu historia de amor única.">
                            We offer the same professional DJ, photography, and lighting services for your wedding day. Our dedicated team works closely with you to create a personalized experience that reflects your unique love story.
                        </p>
                        
                        <div class="weddings-features">
                            <div class="wedding-feature">
                                <i class="fas fa-heart"></i>
                                <div>
                                    <h4 data-en="Personalized Planning" data-es="Planificación Personalizada">Personalized Planning</h4>
                                    <p data-en="Custom music selections and timeline coordination" data-es="Selecciones musicales personalizadas y coordinación de cronograma">Custom music selections and timeline coordination</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="wedding-feature">
                                <i class="fas fa-rings-wedding"></i>
                                <div>
                                    <h4 data-en="Ceremony to Reception" data-es="Ceremonia a Recepción">Ceremony to Reception</h4>
                                    <p data-en="Seamless entertainment from start to finish" data-es="Entretenimiento sin interrupciones de principio a fin">Seamless entertainment from start to finish</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="wedding-feature">
                                <i class="fas fa-star"></i>
                                <div>
                                    <h4 data-en="Elegant Ambiance" data-es="Ambiente Elegante">Elegant Ambiance</h4>
                                    <p data-en="Sophisticated lighting that transforms your venue" data-es="Iluminación sofisticada que transforma tu lugar">Sophisticated lighting that transforms your venue</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <a href="weddings.html" class="btn btn-primary" data-en="Explore Wedding Services" data-es="Explorar Servicios de Boda">
                            Explore Wedding Services
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="weddings-image">
                        <img src="images/first_dance.jpeg" alt="Wedding celebration and first dance" title="Wedding First Dance - Metro Beat Events" loading="lazy">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Why Choose Us Section -->
        <section class="why-choose-us" style="padding: 80px 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 27, 109, 0.05), rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.05));">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px;">Why Choose Metro Beat Events for Your Quinceañera?</h2>
