                    <div style="padding: 30px; background: white; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-left: 4px solid #00D4FF;">
                        <div style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; color: #00D4FF; margin-bottom: 10px;">🎵</div>
                        <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 18px;">Customized Packages</h3>
