                        <div style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; color: #FF1B6D; margin-bottom: 10px;">⚡</div>
                        <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 18px;">Backup Equipment</h3>
                        <p style="margin: 0; color: #666;">Redundant systems ensure your event never stops</p>
                    </div>
